  "content": "<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b102a4bb66a031e198001aff786ba89baebed464.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry Logo\" style=\"width: 200px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n\n## 📖 概述：\n**Jaam's Weaponry（贾姆武器库）** 是一款原版增强型（vanilla+）战斗扩展模组，旨在极大地丰富玩家可用的玩法风格。该模组专注于拓展和完善《我的世界》的战斗系统，引入了大量新武器，每种武器都有独特的机制和行为，使每一场战斗都显得与众不同且充满冲击力。\n\n模组在引入各种新型武器的同时，也对现有的原版军械库以及原版生物使用的装备进行了重新设计和强化。这些改进让新旧武器在使用时更加协调、平衡，并为游戏的进程增添了更多的刺激感。\n\n本模组鼓励玩家掌握时机、移动和创意，旨在使战斗更具沉浸感、策略性和回报性。每一种新武器的加入都允许玩家发展自己的战斗风格并适应新的挑战，为 PvE 和 PvP 遭遇战提供全新的应对方式。\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3527bfcb8783709b78507a5b919fcf9852f32b1.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry Intro Image\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n\n## 🎯 特性：\n- **+50 种新武器，包括分级独特武器、远程武器和枪械。**\n- **+50 种新的武器能力和机制。**\n- **新增效果、附魔和进度目标。**\n- **改进的原版敌对生物装备。**\n- **优化原版战斗和武器。**\n- **武器皮肤和彩蛋。**\n- **专门的模组兼容性支持。**\n- **高级工具提示系统。**\n- **广泛的配置选项。**\n- **更多！**\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eceb2b7214cd8cf07ae564125bddebfa4b251d9c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry 1.0.0 Base Content Image\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n</center>\n\n</details>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n\n## 🤝 兼容性：\n- [Better Combat](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-combat)\n- [Epic Fight](https://modrinth.com/mod/epic-fight)\n- [Jaam's Shinerite](https://modrinth.com/mod/jaams-shinerite)\n- [Deeper Caves](https://modrinth.com/mod/deeper_caves)\n- [Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty](https://modrinth.com/mod/majruszs-progressive-difficulty)\n- [Oreganized](https://modrinth.com/mod/oreganized)\n- [Farmer's Delight](https://modrinth.com/mod/farmers-delight)\n- [Supplementaries](https://modrinth.com/mod/supplementaries)\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2340c1053b51493b3aa5959230ccd708af5349b.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry Mod Compatibility Image\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n\n## ⚙️ 推荐模组：\n- [Model Gap Fix](https://modrinth.com/mod/modelfix)\n- [Enchantment Descriptions](https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-descriptions)\n- [Just Enough Items (JEI)](https://modrinth.com/mod/jei)\n- [Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)](https://modrinth.com/mod/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed)\n- [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured)\n- [Catalogue](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue)\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd44ea92420f980543380791c8ac588d4d59b5c4.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry Recommended Mods Image\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n\n## 🚧 未来计划：\n- **主题更新和社区反馈整合。**\n- **更多武器类型和战斗机制。**\n- **与其他大型模组的兼容性扩展。**\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8ad6f2c3782fdeab1986cc27120438c0ac74cc4a.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Weaponry Future Plans Image\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c3b4d92a9990da8629366220d0dbacc38e0e15c.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Spacer Image\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ApZgFR7zZv\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b8d00233a6ec0f20dc764be5d53d6a085802ab76.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Discord Logo\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n  </a>&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Jaamleeto\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1a619d03a777f42c9ce0a4ff0a36824d2d7284d0.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's Patreon Logo\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n  </a>&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/jaamleeto\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fee30ff77052fbd3997f5bdf3ef87ccb872c0e49.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's GitHub Logo\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n  </a>&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Jaamleeto\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ecacaaef865361dab2ab6a92fa0711552bc1a1f.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's YouTube Logo\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n  </a>&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/jaamleeto\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8b3ae2e878a4235cd3016b1fc0afb1649dc0f60.png\" alt=\"Jaamleeto's LinkTree Logo\" style=\"width: 50px;\">\n  </a>\n  \n</center>\n<br>",
